<title>FRANCE: EU approves 200,000 tns wheat import quota.</title>
<headline>EU approves 200,000 tns wheat import quota.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union approved on Thursday a 200,000 tonne quota for the import of high quality soft wheat and durum wheat into the Community, the French national cereals office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The total was made up of 100,000 tonnes of soft wheat and 100,000 tonnes of durum wheat.</p>
<p>The measure is part of commercial concessions granted under GATT.</p>
<p>The date of the first auction is not yet known.</p>
<p>((-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452))</p>
</text>
